WEBVTT

00:06.670 --> 00:09.540
<b>Don't give up! I swear...</b>

00:10.420 --> 00:12.880
<b>...we'll save you!</b>

00:18.710 --> 00:22.250
<b>Yamato! Grab on!</b>

00:24.080 --> 00:24.830
<b>Noda</b>

00:30.920 --> 00:31.710
<b>Got it!</b>

00:32.210 --> 00:33.330
<b>Yone</b>

00:33.330 --> 00:34.750
<b>Yamato!</b>

00:41.000 --> 00:43.130
<b>I got it, Black!</b>

00:48.540 --> 00:49.920
<b>The time has come.</b>

00:50.330 --> 00:54.960
<b>That is indeed the crimsonite pitcher desired
by the goddess of the harvest!</b>

00:55.210 --> 00:59.250
<b>You mean the kettle Old Lady Yone from
the third district lost out in the fields.</b>

01:00.630 --> 01:01.420
<b>Hmph...</b>

01:02.880 --> 01:05.500
<b>Once we deliver this, our mission's complete!</b>

01:06.080 --> 01:08.460
<b>They're up to something again.</b>

01:08.460 --> 01:11.250
<b>Out helping people, right? Good for them.</b>

01:11.880 --> 01:15.250
<b>You'll catch a cold. Get out of there already!</b>

01:16.830 --> 01:17.630
<b>Wup!</b>

01:18.420 --> 01:19.630
<b>Okay!</b>

01:36.790 --> 01:39.170
<b>That's right, I have awakened</b>

01:39.170 --> 01:42.000
<b>I posses a special power</b>

01:42.000 --> 01:44.210
<b>Before this barrier of mine</b>

01:44.210 --> 01:48.670
<b>All are powerless</b>

01:51.750 --> 01:54.460
<b>Perhaps the reincarnation of an angel or a devil</b>

01:54.460 --> 01:57.250
<b>I can see the unseen</b>

01:57.250 --> 01:59.460
<b>My right arm is throbbing</b>

01:59.460 --> 02:01.830
<b>But I can't unleash it yet</b>

02:01.960 --> 02:04.630
<b>Neither a kid nor an adult</b>

02:04.630 --> 02:06.960
<b>Bust open some philosophy piercings</b>

02:06.960 --> 02:10.750
<b>Cassis orange, fried chicken, squeeze some lemon on and go!</b>

02:11.040 --> 02:13.330
<b>(Drink, drink, drink, drink it up!)</b>

02:13.500 --> 02:15.830
<b>I've got a complication, there's a fanfare in my head</b>

02:15.830 --> 02:18.330
<b>Mingled in the darkness of solitude and twisted logic</b>

02:18.330 --> 02:20.920
<b>I can't find a proper remedy</b>

02:20.920 --> 02:23.290
<b>It's the destiny of those born as men</b>

02:23.290 --> 02:26.130
<b>I've got to discover my true self</b>

02:26.130 --> 02:28.630
<b>Go Forth and Illuminate, Searchlight!</b>

02:28.630 --> 02:31.040
<b>I've got a complication, there's a fanfare in my head</b>

02:31.040 --> 02:33.500
<b>Swaying in the gap between ideals and reality</b>

02:33.500 --> 02:36.080
<b>I don't see a solution</b>

02:36.080 --> 02:38.630
<b>If it's my fate to live for the moment</b>

02:38.630 --> 02:41.250
<b>I've got to discover my true self</b>

02:39.250 --> 02:40.290
<b>Noda</b>

02:41.420 --> 02:43.750
<b>Go Forth and Illuminate, Searchlight!</b>

02:43.750 --> 02:46.330
<b>Eternal Force Blizzard!</b>

02:52.290 --> 02:55.250
<b>Episode 1</b>

02:52.290 --> 02:55.250
<b>That's Right, I Have Awakened</b>

02:53.580 --> 02:55.540
<b>Minakami Private High School</b>

03:01.960 --> 03:04.330
<b>Okay, go ahead and introduce yourself.</b>

03:05.580 --> 03:08.080
<b>Mizuki</b>

03:05.580 --> 03:08.080
<b>Hijiri</b>

03:06.790 --> 03:08.130
<b>Hello, everybody.</b>

03:08.750 --> 03:11.000
<b>My name is Mizuki Hiji...ri?!</b>

03:11.830 --> 03:13.000
<b>Pink!</b>

03:14.170 --> 03:14.960
<b>What?</b>

03:15.960 --> 03:20.540
<b>Yup... I can tell! You're Pink!</b>

03:20.830 --> 03:24.290
<b>"You"? You mean me? "P-Pink"?!</b>

03:24.460 --> 03:28.710
<b>Noda, you're freaking out the transfer student. Sit down.</b>

03:28.710 --> 03:29.630
<b>Okay!</b>

03:31.170 --> 03:33.830
<b>With a last name like that, you figure she's a healer?</b>

03:35.330 --> 03:39.040
<b>Come on baby, I'll hold you in a clever embrace.</b>

03:45.420 --> 03:48.460
<b>I got crushed by that limited edition gacha...</b>

03:45.420 --> 03:48.460
<b>Note: Gacha, in-game lottery</b>

03:48.630 --> 03:51.130
<b>Takashima. Put your smartphone away.</b>

03:52.000 --> 03:55.580
<b>Missed you again today, Sora-chan!</b>

03:58.540 --> 04:01.000
<b>N-nice to meet you all.</b>

04:01.880 --> 04:04.540
<b>Classics</b>

04:01.880 --> 04:04.540
<b>Classics</b>

04:01.880 --> 04:04.540
<b>P.E.          World History B</b>

04:07.500 --> 04:10.710
<b>I'm Yamato Noda! Great to meet you, Pink!</b>

04:13.290 --> 04:15.500
<b>My secret alter ego is Red!</b>

04:17.460 --> 04:18.330
<b>Eek!</b>

04:18.960 --> 04:21.920
<b>You don't have textbooks yet, right? I've gotcha covered!</b>

04:21.920 --> 04:23.750
<b>Th-thanks...</b>

04:29.420 --> 04:30.330
<b>Uh...?</b>

04:36.630 --> 04:39.500
<b>Your power level's pretty amazing!</b>

04:40.920 --> 04:44.130
<b>He's close! Too close! I'm scared...</b>

04:45.330 --> 04:46.000
<b>Let's go.</b>

04:46.000 --> 04:46.670
<b>Yup.</b>

04:58.290 --> 04:59.710
<b>This isn't right...</b>

04:59.710 --> 05:02.750
<b>I wanted to say a typical hello,
mingle quietly into the class,</b>

05:02.750 --> 05:05.960
<b>make some friends, and lead my schooldays in peace...</b>

05:06.750 --> 05:09.130
<b>Why is everyone keeping their distance?</b>

05:09.250 --> 05:11.290
<b>I'm off to a horrible start!</b>

05:12.710 --> 05:13.920
<b>What do I do...?</b>

05:15.460 --> 05:16.380
<b>What's the matter?</b>

05:16.380 --> 05:17.170
<b>Huh?</b>

05:19.670 --> 05:23.540
<b>I'm Nanako Watase, the class rep. Nice to meet you.</b>

05:23.750 --> 05:25.460
<b>The pleasure's all mine.</b>

05:26.420 --> 05:28.500
<b>Who is this savior...?!</b>

05:29.170 --> 05:31.540
<b>I'd be happy to help if you don't mind.</b>

05:31.540 --> 05:33.710
<b>Oh... uh...</b>

05:34.250 --> 05:37.130
<b>I can't just come out and say that I want friends.</b>

05:38.040 --> 05:39.830
<b>Yeah, okay...</b>

05:43.250 --> 05:46.420
<b>If you don't want to tell me,
you could go to the old school building.</b>

05:46.420 --> 05:48.170
<b>"O-old school building"?</b>

05:48.710 --> 05:53.540
<b>Yeah. Our school has a club that helps people in trouble.</b>

05:54.710 --> 05:56.710
<b>Uh, I don't know if I'd count on them.</b>

05:56.710 --> 05:58.710
<b>They're interesting, sure...</b>

05:58.710 --> 06:03.080
<b>Really? But my granny said they helped her out.</b>

06:03.080 --> 06:05.290
<b>What? Really?!</b>

06:06.380 --> 06:09.330
<b>What's with that reaction? Doesn't sound promising at all.</b>

06:10.170 --> 06:14.710
<b>But... it is my first day, and she means well.</b>

06:15.790 --> 06:18.000
<b>Thanks. I'll go check it out.</b>

06:23.670 --> 06:27.580
<b>Hero Club</b>

06:23.670 --> 06:27.580
<b>Room</b>

06:23.670 --> 06:27.580
<b>Please press</b>

06:23.670 --> 06:27.580
<b>for assistance.</b>

06:25.420 --> 06:26.920
<b>The "Hero Club"?</b>

06:28.210 --> 06:29.630
<b>I guess this is it.</b>

06:38.790 --> 06:39.830
<b>It doesn't ring?</b>

06:41.580 --> 06:42.830
<b>This won't open!</b>

06:45.880 --> 06:46.920
<b>It slides?!</b>

06:49.460 --> 06:51.080
<b>S-sorry!</b>

06:51.540 --> 06:52.580
<b>Welcome.</b>

06:56.130 --> 06:57.170
<b>Pink!</b>

06:57.380 --> 06:58.630
<b>Ack! It's you!</b>

06:58.920 --> 07:03.380
<b>Welcome... to... the... Hero Club!</b>

07:07.170 --> 07:09.880
<b>Special event on now!</b>

07:07.170 --> 07:09.880
<b>Concert</b>

07:07.170 --> 07:09.880
<b>Lesson</b>

07:07.170 --> 07:09.880
<b>Gacha</b>

07:07.380 --> 07:09.710
<b>I just knew you'd come!</b>

07:12.080 --> 07:12.960
<b>I'm going.</b>

07:15.330 --> 07:16.080
<b>Wait!</b>

07:18.000 --> 07:21.210
<b>I knew you'd make it here on your own, Pink!</b>

07:21.210 --> 07:23.460
<b>I wouldn't have come if I knew you were here!</b>

07:24.250 --> 07:25.790
<b>So what's "pink"?</b>

07:26.080 --> 07:26.960
<b>Ahem.</b>

07:27.960 --> 07:32.830
<b>Well, basically, Yamato loves live action
superhero shows a bit too much, and-</b>

07:32.830 --> 07:35.290
<b>I'm Red! This one's Yellow!</b>

07:35.880 --> 07:38.330
<b>The handsome guy is never Yellow.</b>

07:35.880 --> 07:38.330
<b>Note: Yellow is typically the comedic relief.</b>

07:38.920 --> 07:40.500
<b>I'm Tomoki Takashima.</b>

07:40.500 --> 07:42.580
<b>You sit diagonally in front of me.</b>

07:42.580 --> 07:43.250
<b>Yup.</b>

07:44.750 --> 07:46.330
<b>And that's Black!</b>

07:46.710 --> 07:50.830
<b>The true name carved into my soul is Toga Ryushoin-!</b>

08:01.710 --> 08:05.630
<b>S-settle down, right arm...!</b>

08:06.290 --> 08:10.080
<b>Calm yourself. I can't... unleash you yet...!</b>

08:10.880 --> 08:14.210
<b>Gildivalan... I shan't... let you...</b>

08:14.580 --> 08:17.540
<b>...take... me over!</b>

08:23.080 --> 08:28.960
<b>You wish to know about me?
In this life, my name is Kazuhiro Nakamura, Class 1-A.</b>

08:29.080 --> 08:34.710
<b>In my last life, I was born out of a forbidden union
between an angel and a demon.</b>

08:34.880 --> 08:39.710
<b>That is why in this life, I can see the unseen.</b>

08:36.250 --> 08:39.000
<b>And the one who got his shoulder slammed...</b>

08:39.000 --> 08:39.710
<b>Oh...</b>

08:39.960 --> 08:41.130
<b>...is Rei Tsukumo.</b>

08:41.130 --> 08:42.210
<b>He's Purple!</b>

08:43.330 --> 08:44.580
<b>This is ridiculous.</b>

08:51.170 --> 08:52.960
<b>I just had this hunch...!</b>

08:52.960 --> 08:56.750
<b>That the five destined warriors
would gather at this school!</b>

08:56.880 --> 09:01.380
<b>Basically, Yamato delusionally
thinks you're Pink, Hijiri-san.</b>

09:01.380 --> 09:02.250
<b>Excuse me?!</b>

09:02.790 --> 09:04.380
<b>It's not a delusion!</b>

09:04.960 --> 09:09.130
<b>That eye patch is for suppressing
some special power in your right eye, right?</b>

09:09.330 --> 09:11.080
<b>My eye just got infected!</b>

09:13.540 --> 09:15.920
<b>Y-you mean your powers have yet to awaken?!</b>

09:16.250 --> 09:18.920
<b>They never will! For the rest of my life!</b>

09:19.420 --> 09:24.960
<b>If you haven't awakened yet...
you're a sitting duck for the Agency!</b>

09:25.290 --> 09:26.630
<b>Uh, "agency"?</b>

09:27.250 --> 09:29.880
<b>Takashima-kun, can you do something about this kid?</b>

09:30.040 --> 09:32.960
<b>Can't. I'm on a date with Sora-chan.</b>

09:33.130 --> 09:35.330
<b>Sora</b>

09:33.130 --> 09:35.330
<b>Good morning ♡</b>

09:33.130 --> 09:35.330
<b>Let's have another great day ☺♡♡</b>

09:34.380 --> 09:35.380
<b>Is that a game?</b>

09:35.830 --> 09:37.130
<b>It's iLive!</b>

09:37.290 --> 09:41.630
<b>This is key time for nurturing my love with Sora-chan!</b>

09:42.460 --> 09:44.130
<b>What a waste of good looks...</b>

09:44.670 --> 09:47.210
<b>I devote everything to Sora-chan!</b>

09:47.380 --> 09:57.080
<b>Sora-chan</b>

09:47.710 --> 09:49.880
<b>Recess, time for studying, time for sleep...</b>

09:49.880 --> 09:51.960
<b>In-game events always get top priority!</b>

09:52.250 --> 09:57.130
<b>If a cafe is having a character collaboration,
I'll eat every item on the menu even if my belly bursts!</b>

09:57.920 --> 10:00.040
<b>You'll upset your stomach...</b>

10:00.790 --> 10:03.630
<b>I collect absolutely all items and
extras using everything I've got,</b>

10:03.630 --> 10:08.710
<b>be it funds from my allowance,
doing chores, or part time jobs!</b>

10:09.000 --> 10:12.290
<b>That's right, 2D girls are ultimate and supreme!</b>

10:12.670 --> 10:15.710
<b>Sora-chan, I love you!</b>

10:19.630 --> 10:25.290
<b>"This glowing season"..." Precious memories with you"...</b>

10:28.830 --> 10:32.380
<b>Don't tell me you're... falling in love with me?</b>

10:35.080 --> 10:42.000
<b>Sure, I have the looks and a body to match.
My grades are above average and I'm a good singer...</b>

10:43.630 --> 10:48.000
<b>But sorry... I have no interest in real girls.</b>

10:48.630 --> 10:50.130
<b>Uh-huh...</b>

10:50.130 --> 10:53.210
<b>Thanks to Pink, the Hero Club is complete!</b>

10:53.210 --> 10:58.670
<b>H-hold on! I'm not Pink,
and I'm planning to join the Gardening Club!</b>

11:02.080 --> 11:04.210
<b>Then why are you here?</b>

11:04.540 --> 11:08.710
<b>Well... I was told I should come here if I need help...</b>

11:08.710 --> 11:10.960
<b>If you need a textbook, you can use mine!</b>

11:10.960 --> 11:12.460
<b>That's not what I need help with!</b>

11:12.710 --> 11:13.960
<b>Don't worry!</b>

11:14.960 --> 11:16.830
<b>We're comrades, right?!</b>

11:19.250 --> 11:23.830
<b>They're idiots... All of them are hopeless idiots...</b>

11:24.080 --> 11:30.830
<b>Those who are wise do not court danger</b>

11:24.080 --> 11:30.830
<b>Toga Ryushoin</b>

11:25.630 --> 11:30.880
<b>I just want to enjoy my school days
in peace with some friends.</b>

11:30.880 --> 11:32.830
<b>Gotcha! "Friends," huh?</b>

11:32.830 --> 11:34.710
<b>"Peace," too! That's important!</b>

11:34.880 --> 11:37.290
<b>You'll probably need about a hundred...</b>

11:37.290 --> 11:38.880
<b>He ignored the "peace" part!</b>

11:40.080 --> 11:41.630
<b>Seriously, I'm all good now.</b>

11:42.080 --> 11:45.130
<b>Anyway, gotta go. Class is starting soon...</b>

11:52.630 --> 11:53.290
<b>Oh right...</b>

11:54.380 --> 11:56.080
<b>He sits next to me...!</b>

11:56.080 --> 11:57.580
<b>Don't get yourself down, Pink!</b>

11:58.790 --> 12:02.580
<b>I'll make sure your mission to make
a hundred friends succeeds!</b>

12:02.960 --> 12:05.130
<b>But I don't need a hundred...</b>

12:07.920 --> 12:09.710
<b>Outburst Dreamer Boys!</b>

12:13.330 --> 12:15.000
<b>Outburst Dreamer Boys!</b>

12:29.380 --> 12:30.920
<b>Good morning, Hijiri-san.</b>

12:31.210 --> 12:32.130
<b>Good morning.</b>

12:32.500 --> 12:35.540
<b>You got all your textbooks, huh? That's great!</b>

12:35.540 --> 12:38.330
<b>Yup. Now I can focus in class.</b>

12:40.960 --> 12:44.630
<b>Oh right, we're doing practice games
this afternoon for the ball sports tournament.</b>

12:44.880 --> 12:48.380
<b>The locker room's gonna get crowded.
We should get changed early.</b>

12:50.170 --> 12:50.920
<b>Huh?</b>

12:56.710 --> 13:00.920
<b>Burning drive!</b>

13:05.040 --> 13:06.790
<b>What?! This is the second floor!</b>

13:09.460 --> 13:10.130
<b>Boom!</b>

13:10.130 --> 13:11.790
<b>Wow, that was crazy!</b>

13:12.880 --> 13:15.330
<b>Did you see that? My free form goal!</b>

13:15.670 --> 13:17.420
<b>Amazing as always, Noda!</b>

13:19.250 --> 13:20.460
<b>Are you okay?</b>

13:20.460 --> 13:22.250
<b>Huh? Oh, yeah...</b>

13:22.250 --> 13:24.170
<b>Uh, didn't he just jump from here?</b>

13:24.500 --> 13:27.880
<b>Well, Noda-kun's really good at sports.</b>

13:27.880 --> 13:31.710
<b>But he jumped from the second floor.
That's way better than just "good"!</b>

13:32.460 --> 13:34.710
<b>You okay there, Pink?!</b>

13:35.080 --> 13:37.960
<b>Don't call me weird names in such a loud voice!</b>

13:46.210 --> 13:47.040
<b>Huh?</b>

13:51.790 --> 13:53.210
<b>Thanks for earlier.</b>

13:53.630 --> 13:55.670
<b>But I wish you wouldn't call me "Pink."</b>

13:57.040 --> 13:58.790
<b>Good thing you weren't hurt!</b>

14:09.790 --> 14:11.290
<b>Thanks for the meal.</b>

14:11.880 --> 14:13.080
<b>Mizuki Hijiri.</b>

14:14.330 --> 14:15.830
<b>Why'd he say my full name?</b>

14:17.250 --> 14:18.330
<b>Can I have a moment?</b>

14:19.380 --> 14:20.500
<b>Okay...</b>

14:21.580 --> 14:23.750
<b>I pondered over this last night,</b>

14:24.000 --> 14:28.080
<b>but perhaps you should track the ties
from your previous life to make friends.</b>

14:28.630 --> 14:33.880
<b>By encountering kindred souls from
your previous life, new paths will open up,</b>

14:33.880 --> 14:39.000
<b>and that meeting of souls will bring about
an unlimited Big Bang of possibilities-</b>

14:39.000 --> 14:41.790
<b>It's fine. The class rep Watase-san is pretty-</b>

14:43.330 --> 14:44.670
<b>Zounds! Is that a villain?!</b>

14:49.960 --> 14:50.880
<b>Are you okay?!</b>

14:51.830 --> 14:52.920
<b>What is this?</b>

14:54.330 --> 14:55.580
<b>It's a toy.</b>

14:58.210 --> 14:59.330
<b>Don't underestimate it!</b>

15:00.040 --> 15:04.210
<b>That's most likely a cockatrice garuda
that swooped in from the void!</b>

15:04.380 --> 15:10.960
<b>These white hands bestowed upon me by the billion-fold
world shall carve their divine power into your body!</b>

15:11.670 --> 15:15.710
<b>If that's all... s-see you later.</b>

15:18.670 --> 15:20.580
<b>What was that all about?</b>

15:24.000 --> 15:27.540
<b>Takashima-kun has a lot of friends, huh? Looks fun.</b>

15:24.420 --> 15:26.500
<b>I'm serious. Funny, right?</b>

15:26.500 --> 15:27.540
<b>Really?</b>

15:27.540 --> 15:28.580
<b>That's awesome.</b>

15:33.790 --> 15:34.670
<b>Hey.</b>

15:35.380 --> 15:36.250
<b>What?</b>

15:36.920 --> 15:43.330
<b>I thought I'd introduce you to my friends.
They're all nice, so I'm sure you'll click with someone.</b>

15:43.330 --> 15:44.080
<b>Huh?</b>

15:44.670 --> 15:46.880
<b>He has normal female friends!</b>

15:47.290 --> 15:49.330
<b>I guess he is attractive
as long as he keeps his mouth shut.</b>

15:49.750 --> 15:50.500
<b>Here.</b>

15:50.580 --> 15:52.960
<b>iLive</b>

15:50.580 --> 15:52.960
<b>Start Game</b>

15:53.380 --> 15:54.710
<b>2D friends?!</b>

15:56.130 --> 15:59.920
<b>Hijiri-san! We've got to change. Let's go together!</b>

15:59.920 --> 16:01.000
<b>Oh, right!</b>

16:03.500 --> 16:04.250
<b>Close it!</b>

16:09.580 --> 16:10.830
<b>Hijiri-san!</b>

16:10.830 --> 16:13.750
<b>Uh, yeah! I-I'm gonna go.</b>

16:16.880 --> 16:20.040
<b>This is an emergency. Get hold of Black and Purple!</b>

16:25.250 --> 16:26.250
<b>Where's Purple?</b>

16:26.790 --> 16:28.040
<b>Busy, apparently.</b>

16:28.290 --> 16:29.290
<b>Huh?</b>

16:29.500 --> 16:31.880
<b>Oh well, then. Let's get to it.</b>

16:32.330 --> 16:33.460
<b>Take a look at this.</b>

16:33.960 --> 16:34.920
<b>Hmm?</b>

16:35.830 --> 16:38.630
<b>It's obvious. Someone's after Pink.</b>

16:40.040 --> 16:41.130
<b>That time...</b>

16:41.630 --> 16:43.580
<b>...when she was talking to me...</b>

16:44.080 --> 16:45.250
<b>...and just now.</b>

16:46.290 --> 16:48.540
<b>These were all aimed at Pink.</b>

16:49.080 --> 16:50.710
<b>Who'd do such a thing?</b>

16:51.250 --> 16:53.380
<b>The Agency must be on the move!</b>

16:54.580 --> 16:57.540
<b>Maybe Pink's on the verge of awakening!</b>

16:58.000 --> 17:03.580
<b>That's it! They mean to finish her off before
she gets a hold of special powers!</b>

17:03.830 --> 17:06.380
<b>That means we've got to protect Pink!</b>

17:07.000 --> 17:10.250
<b>But what about her mission to make friends?</b>

17:11.380 --> 17:13.080
<b>That's under control!</b>

17:17.170 --> 17:19.380
<b>Our school has a lot of events.</b>

17:19.380 --> 17:21.920
<b>Yeah? That sounds like fun.</b>

17:22.170 --> 17:23.960
<b>I don't want to be alone at the events!</b>

17:24.210 --> 17:24.880
<b>Oh?</b>

17:28.380 --> 17:29.210
<b>Huh?</b>

17:38.580 --> 17:40.040
<b>Paper airplanes?</b>

17:41.420 --> 17:42.630
<b>They're so pretty...</b>

17:56.920 --> 17:58.880
<b>Th-this...</b>

18:00.170 --> 18:02.290
<b>Don't tell me they're all...?!</b>

18:04.210 --> 18:07.380
<b>Don't look!</b>

18:09.630 --> 18:14.420
<b>"Looking to make friends.
Class 1-C, Mizuki Hijiri, parentheses Pink."</b>

18:09.630 --> 18:12.580
<b>Looking to make friends!</b>

18:09.630 --> 18:12.580
<b>Class 1-C Mizuki Hijiri</b>

18:09.630 --> 18:12.580
<b>(Pink)</b>

18:15.830 --> 18:16.880
<b>That voice!</b>

18:20.000 --> 18:25.170
<b>So you came to that room just because
you want to make some makeshift friends.</b>

18:26.920 --> 18:28.040
<b>What a joke.</b>

18:33.710 --> 18:34.790
<b>You three!</b>

18:36.380 --> 18:37.460
<b>Hey, Pink!</b>

18:38.130 --> 18:41.250
<b>Looking to</b>

18:38.130 --> 18:41.250
<b>make friends!</b>

18:38.710 --> 18:41.040
<b>Don't "hey, Pink" me! What's this?!</b>

18:41.540 --> 18:42.920
<b>Great idea, huh?</b>

18:42.920 --> 18:47.290
<b>How?! Are you an idiot?! It looks like I did this!</b>

18:47.540 --> 18:51.500
<b>I just want to lead a normal school life in peace!</b>

18:52.130 --> 18:53.920
<b>Please, just leave me alone!</b>

18:56.790 --> 18:57.420
<b>Wait!</b>

18:58.000 --> 19:00.250
<b>I said, leave me alone!</b>

19:01.500 --> 19:03.420
<b>Why? How did this happen?</b>

19:04.170 --> 19:07.630
<b>Mizuki Hijiri. You're being targeted.</b>

19:08.290 --> 19:11.170
<b>That's right. This came flying at you earlier, too.</b>

19:11.630 --> 19:13.330
<b>That's just a coincidence!</b>

19:13.330 --> 19:14.750
<b>It's dangerous on your own!</b>

19:14.750 --> 19:16.210
<b>Just back off, okay?!</b>

19:26.580 --> 19:28.460
<b>What do you do on the weekends?</b>

19:28.880 --> 19:32.170
<b>Hmm, I read books, listen to music...</b>

19:32.380 --> 19:34.250
<b>I like Vocaloid tunes.</b>

19:34.250 --> 19:36.830
<b>Oh yeah, they're great! I like those, too.</b>

19:40.210 --> 19:44.380
<b>They must have agents mingled in the crowd...
What are they up to?!</b>

19:47.250 --> 19:48.210
<b>Watase!</b>

19:49.210 --> 19:50.250
<b>Sorry.</b>

19:52.790 --> 19:53.630
<b>Shoot!</b>

19:56.210 --> 19:57.290
<b>She dodged it!</b>

20:01.920 --> 20:02.960
<b>You've awakened.</b>

20:05.040 --> 20:09.170
<b>You can control your right eye's powers now,
even without the eye patch!</b>

20:10.250 --> 20:11.540
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

20:11.540 --> 20:12.920
<b>You don't have to hide it!</b>

20:14.380 --> 20:16.920
<b>You just dodged that ball, Pink!</b>

20:18.540 --> 20:20.040
<b>This sensation...</b>

20:20.540 --> 20:24.210
<b>These recurrent attacks! The enemy is among us!</b>

20:26.080 --> 20:26.880
<b>Go Forth...</b>

20:30.080 --> 20:37.080
<b>...and Illuminate, Searchlight!</b>

20:44.000 --> 20:45.130
<b>Impressive...</b>

20:45.670 --> 20:51.710
<b>My searchlight detects any evil soul within
a ten-kilometer radius, but they neutralized it...!</b>

21:00.040 --> 21:00.830
<b>Yamato!</b>

21:20.040 --> 21:21.250
<b>That was a close one!</b>

21:22.080 --> 21:24.880
<b>What's going on?! What happened?!</b>

21:24.880 --> 21:25.710
<b>Stand back!</b>

21:30.000 --> 21:31.880
<b>The culprit is among us.</b>

21:32.210 --> 21:33.040
<b>What?!</b>

21:34.380 --> 21:35.170
<b>Huh...?</b>

21:36.130 --> 21:38.500
<b>Someone's actually after me?!</b>

21:39.960 --> 21:42.130
<b>That's right. The culprit...</b>

21:50.630 --> 21:51.960
<b>...is you!</b>

22:03.540 --> 22:08.210
<b>A vivid melody shrouded in a seasonal wind</b>

22:08.210 --> 22:11.290
<b>Calls to me</b>

22:11.540 --> 22:18.750
<b>Rhythm overflows, accelerating the sound of footsteps</b>

22:19.170 --> 22:27.000
<b>Let's go look for something we'll never
get with our heads hanging down</b>

22:27.170 --> 22:37.250
<b>If I go with you, I'm sure we can leap over the highest of walls</b>

22:37.670 --> 22:39.960
<b>Let's get started! All right?</b>

22:40.290 --> 22:44.210
<b>We still have a long long way to go</b>

22:44.210 --> 22:47.420
<b>On those wings you illustrated</b>

22:47.420 --> 22:51.210
<b>Keep flying, and to a story</b>

22:51.460 --> 22:56.080
<b>We'll soar through tomorrow</b>

22:56.080 --> 23:00.210
<b>We still have a long long way to go</b>

23:00.210 --> 23:03.540
<b>That heartbeat that won't disappear</b>

23:03.540 --> 23:07.460
<b>Keep trying, and to a story</b>

23:07.460 --> 23:11.130
<b>Harmonies overlap</b>

23:11.290 --> 23:16.920
<b>The image of the future that doesn't belong to anyone</b>

23:17.290 --> 23:22.290
<b>I'll draw it, with you</b>

23:26.540 --> 23:29.000
<b>This is bad, Pink! The evil Agency is after you!</b>

23:26.540 --> 23:27.670
<b>Next episode preview!</b>

23:29.000 --> 23:31.040
<b>What do I do?! I have no idea what you're talking about!</b>

23:29.750 --> 23:34.710
<b>Guess it can't be helped. Let's go kick some ass.</b>

23:29.830 --> 23:34.880
<b>Oh well, "they" really don't know how to wait...</b>

23:30.920 --> 23:34.630
<b>What are you all fighting against...?</b>

23:31.000 --> 23:33.670
<b>No! It's far too early!</b>

23:31.040 --> 23:34.420
<b>Don't worry! We're all going to
Black's house now to see Excalibur!</b>

23:31.080 --> 23:33.580
<b>Right... Let's go!</b>

23:31.630 --> 23:33.170
<b>You've come.</b>

23:34.670 --> 23:36.500
<b>Someone help me, please!</b>

23:34.710 --> 23:36.880
<b>Excalibur is the name of the sword said to be wielded by King Arthur.</b>

23:36.830 --> 23:39.710
<b>Next episode: "Perhaps the Reincarnation
of an Angel or a Devil."</b>

23:36.880 --> 23:38.670
<b>Originally, there was only supposed to have been one Excalibur.</b>

23:38.080 --> 23:40.580
<b>↓ Way too long. I can't read this!</b>

23:38.670 --> 23:40.580
<b>But as The Legend of King Arthur spread across various nations, the story's</b>

23:39.380 --> 23:40.580
<b>↓ Exposition much?</b>

23:39.540 --> 23:40.580
<b>Look at all those words...</b>
